msgctxt "11180"
msgid "Sasai"
msgstr "Sasai"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "72_The Florist"
msgid "...Had some time to take it all in?"
msgstr "... ¿Pudiste procesar todo?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "84_Saejima"
msgid "Yeah. I owe ya one."
msgstr "Sí. Te lo agradezco."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "96_Saejima"
msgid "Thanks for lettin' me see him again."
msgstr "Gracias. Por dejarme verlo de nuevo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "108_The Florist"
msgid "A deal's a deal. So, what will you do now?"
msgstr "Entonces, ¿qué harás ahora?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "120_Saejima"
msgid "There's one more thing I gotta find out."
msgstr "Hay una cosa más que necesito averiguar..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "132_The Florist"
msgid "You mean Majima?"
msgstr "¿Majima?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "144_Saejima"
msgid "Yeah. I gotta know what really happened back in '85.\\r\nI wanna hear it straight from his mouth."
msgstr "Sí, necesito saber lo que realmente pasó hace 25 años.\\r\nQuiero escucharlo directamente de su boca."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "156_Saejima"
msgid "Have I spent half my life behind bars for nothing?\\r\nI can't go out without knowin'."
msgstr "Quiero saber si todos esos 25 años fueron en vano.\\r\nSin eso, no podré descansar en paz, incluso si muero."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "168_The Florist"
msgid "That reminds me. You broke yourself out of prison, right?\\r\nIt would seem the police are hot on your trail."
msgstr "Entiendo. Eres un fugitivo, ¿verdad?\\r\nParece que la policía tiene información de que te vieron en Kamurocho."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "180_The Florist"
msgid "I heard they got wind of you being sighted in Kamurocho.\\r\nThe city's crawling with cops right now."
msgstr "La policía está por todas partes, te recomiendo\\r\nque te escondas hasta que todo se calme."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "192_Saejima"
msgid "Shit..."
msgstr "Mierda..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "204_The Florist"
msgid "You'd better lay low until things calm down.\\r\nYou still have that hideout, don't you?"
msgstr "¿Tienes un escondite, verdad?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "216_Saejima"
msgid "Yep."
msgstr "Sí."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "228_The Florist"
msgid "Then wait it out there for a while. You should be safe\\r\nfrom the police as long as you stay underground."
msgstr "Quédate aquí por un tiempo. Deberías estar a salvo si estás en el subterráneo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "240_The Florist"
msgid "You look big enough to handle a manhole cover. Use those\\r\nto access the sewers and you'll be able to move freely."
msgstr "Seguro que puedes levantar la tapa del alcantarillado.\\r\nSal por ahí y regresa al subterráneo de Kamurocho."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "252_The Florist"
msgid "Right outside here, there's an entrance to an underground\\r\npassage. It'll take you to one of Kamurocho's manholes."
msgstr "Hay una entrada que conduce a las alcantarillas justo al salir de aquí."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "264_The Florist"
msgid "I suggest using those manholes wherever you find them.\\r\nThey'll help you get back to your hideout undetected."
msgstr "También hay otras alcantarillas en Kamurocho a las que puedes acceder. Úsalas sabiamente para regresar a tu escondite."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "276_Saejima"
msgid "Gotcha, thanks."
msgstr "Muy bien, gracias."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "300_The Florist"
msgid "That \"deathmatch\" back at the Underground Coliseum?\\r\nIt was a test."
msgstr "¿La \"pelea a muerte\" del coliseo? Fue solo una prueba."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "312_Saejima"
msgid "What's that s'posed to mean?"
msgstr "¿Una prueba?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "324_The Florist"
msgid "I wanted to see how you'd act under those circumstances.\\r\nI hope you don't hold it against me, but it was necessary."
msgstr "Sí, quería ver como actuabas en una situación como esa.\\r\nNo lo tomes a mal."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "336_Saejima"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "348_The Florist"
msgid "Relax. Ivan will survive. Hell, he'll be back in the ring\\r\nin a week at most."
msgstr "Tranquilo. El hombre que peleó contra ti estará bien.\\r\nEstá en el hospital."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "360_The Florist"
msgid "But for now, he's in the hospital. That was quite a beating\\r\nyou gave him."
msgstr "Se está recuperando de menuda paliza."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "372_Saejima"
msgid "Least I know he's alright."
msgstr "Por lo menos sé que está bien."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "384_The Florist"
msgid "Now, as for that request about your patriarch's fate\\r\nfollowing that incident 25 years ago."
msgstr "Bien, ahora sobre tu petición. Lo que le pasó a Sasai\\r\ndespués de ese incidente de hace 25 años."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "396_The Florist"
msgid "After Sasai stepped down in 1985, the Ueno Seiwa Clan\\r\nput a hit on him, forcing him to go into hiding."
msgstr "Hace 25 años, después de retirarse, Sasai\\r\ncomenzó a ser blanco del clan Ueno Seiwa.\\r\nPor lo tanto, tuvo que esconderse."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "408_Saejima"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "420_The Florist"
msgid "Several months later, someone brought him down here\\r\nto Purgatory, but he was barely clinging to life."
msgstr "Unos meses después, alguien trajo a Sasai,\\r\nmedio muerto al Purgatorio."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "432_The Florist"
msgid "He's been living on the streets since then."
msgstr "Y así, Sasai se convirtió en un vagabundo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "444_Saejima"
msgid "What?"
msgstr "¿Qué?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "456_Saejima"
msgid "You're tellin' me Sasai-san's still alive?"
msgstr "Entonces, ¿el jefe sigue vivo?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "468_The Florist"
msgid "Yes. It was all we could do to keep him from dying.\\r\nHe's homeless now, but he's still in Kamurocho."
msgstr "Sí... A pesar de casi perder la vida y ser un vagabundo.\\r\nSigue en Kamurocho."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "480_Saejima"
msgid "I see."
msgstr "Ya veo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "492_The Florist"
msgid "That said..."
msgstr "Pero..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "504_Saejima"
msgid "What?"
msgstr "¿Qué?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "516_The Florist"
msgid "He's probably－how shall I say－not the man you remember."
msgstr "Cómo decirlo... Él ya no es el Sasai que recuerdas."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "528_Saejima"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr "Uh, ¿y eso?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "540_The Florist"
msgid "I'll have him brought over right now."
msgstr "... Lo traeré ahora mismo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "552_Saejima"
msgid "Here?"
msgstr "¿Caminar, dices?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "564_The Florist"
msgid "Yeah, that's right. Bring him in."
msgstr "Sí, así es. Tráiganlo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "636_Saejima"
msgid " ......"
msgstr " ......"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "660_Saejima"
msgid "That... That's him?"
msgstr "... ¿Je-Jefe?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "708_Sasai"
msgid "Ngh..."
msgstr "Ngh..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "720_The Florist"
msgid "Do you know who brought Sasai down here, half dead,\\r\na quarter century ago? It was Goro Majima."
msgstr "Hace 25 años, fue Majima quien trajo\\r\na Sasai, en estado crítico, a este lugar."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "732_Saejima"
msgid "What!?"
msgstr "¡¿Qué?!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "744_The Florist"
msgid "I can only assume Majima was trying to protect Sasai\\r\nfrom the Ueno Seiwa Clan after you were gone."
msgstr "Mi teoría es que trató de protegerlo del clan Ueno Seiwa en tu lugar."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "756_Sasai"
msgid "Ah... Ohhh..."
msgstr "Ah... Ohhh..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "768_Saejima"
msgid "Sasai-san..."
msgstr "Sasai-san..."

